#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:495 3bbef5ad6b87447ab23e4b8400722bd7
#: 59a1706abd274b839f77970546c2d97e 9e6d3c858c2348c88e1b8f428179b176
#: b2876258c8814bf38089e2b0ad39c0e1 e070463c76dd48f8943d2f15e7ed9a08
#: eb31771745354e5bacffa6f6d94233bb
msgid ""
"The MUPilot has 7 analog inputs * ADC Pin0 -> Battery Voltage * ADC Pin1 -> "
"Battery Current Sensor * ADC Pin2 -> Battery Voltage 2 * ADC Pin3 -> Battery"
" Current Sensor 2 * ADC Pin4 -> ADC port pin 2 * ADC Pin14 -> ADC port pin 3"
" * ADC Pin10 -> Board 5V Sense * ADC Pin11 -> Board 3.3V Sense * ADC Pin103 "
"-> RSSI voltage monitoring"
msgstr ""
"MUPilot 有 7 路模拟输入：* ADC 引脚 0 -> 电池电压 * ADC 引脚 1 -> 电池电流传感器 * ADC 引脚 2 -> "
"电池电压 2 * ADC 引脚 3 -> 电池电流传感器 2 * ADC 引脚 4 -> ADC 端口引脚 2 * ADC 引脚 14 -> ADC "
"端口引脚 3 * ADC 引脚 10 -> 板载 5V 检测 * ADC 引脚 11 -> 板载 3.3V 检测 * ADC 引脚 103 -> "
"RSSI 电压监测"

